{"v":4,"catch":"《不離不棄》是個重視合作的輕鬆有趣的益智遊戲。","desc":"帶著你的朋友或獨自協助不離和不棄克服種種困難。《不離不棄》雖然容易上手，但也同時帶來一系列充滿挑戰性的謎題。\n\n特徵\n\n* 大量的關卡讓你盡情解謎。\n* 風風韻韻的配音讓你輕鬆的思考困難的謎題。\n* 遊戲適合單獨猜謎或和朋友共同克服。互相吼叫不會提高你的解謎技巧，但有個伴總好過少一個。\n* 遊戲隱藏著小秘密。快去找它。","publisher":"Leoful","release":"2022-04-28","genres":["益智","動作","派對"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5361626166233cfb2d605bb5526fdb23dd2c31f7f1b5ab28711572e4b09c4d42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e414d1226c19e1f187ab8ece1f140bf23ac529ee0e2cd3492c1e057ffe45191.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12996a4dd897b7f47b28ae5b8a82f9b75a7ea170fc628be17a2503c1f2f83b9a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a87d8ba08738c2c0a7a7c429c6d1417aa73fff1d0e1ac39ac00f60233c89d5f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3800ac9bec17fe7ea7aacc9590c3b42feed63a3bbf2c364f60604cb88c20b30.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/328e4b161269665683990641d278342edfc49099b548938c1bdd4d6edae68e12.jpg"],"titleId":"010086301490c000","dlc":[]}